{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id117933110"}, "name":{"label":"margie.elaine"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-06T05:31:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.4"}, "id":{"label":"14757566461"}, "title":{"label":"Calm Companion"}, "content":{"label":"I love the Calm app! I got it right when the app was starting and was able to get a lifetime subscription because I worked in education. I am not a therapist and yoga teacher. Meditation has been a lifelong journey and with this app I can come and go without pressure, over time building my capacity for more peace and consistent meditation. I love the keep stories and have used them to help my children. I recommend this app to anyone and everyone whether it be colleagues, friends, family, students or patients. Thank you Calm!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=571800810&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id169003058"}, "name":{"label":"Shawnee831"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-06T05:13:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.4"}, "id":{"label":"14757505143"}, "title":{"label":"Good, but needs updating"}, "content":{"label":"I truly love this app. It has helped me change the way I face the world! Thanks to the daily practices,I am learning to stay focused and present. \nI would, however, LOVE to see more variety!!\nThe daily’s tend to repeat themselves. This is my second full year, and many of the daily practices are repeats! As are the sleep stories. Those are one of my favorite of the app, but in two years, I find the selection limited as I have listened to them over and over!!\nBoring! \nUpdating and changing those would be a huge improvement. Also, you should add more ASMR type stories!! Those would be an Awesome addition!!\nGenerally, it’s a good app, but maybe, with little changes every year, it could be a great app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=571800810&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
