{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1220912744"}, "name":{"label":"Laughingl0tus"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-31T13:20:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"7.4"}, "id":{"label":"14735075216"}, "title":{"label":"App is great billing is awful"}, "content":{"label":"I really love this app.  But it is absolutely unaffordable.  I have searched and searched for financial support, as many apps have scholarships for those who can really benefit but cannot afford the high cost of subscription.  I have found absolutely no scholarships.  None.  But they give it away completely free to members of companies.  So, I tried a company promo code I found through the Reddit sub.  It worked for a couple weeks.  But then I was booted off.  So, I deleted the app and wrote it off forever.  Last week I was really happy when a special pricing offer came up for me:  $39.99 a year.  So, I purchased it.  However I looked into a charge to my account, and lo and behold I was not charged $39.99.  I was charged $79.99.  I am so sick of the shenanigans of this app and its pricing and lack of support for low-income individuals.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=571800810&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-11-23T23:52:32-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
